WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.934
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:05.167
We hope you're doing well.
And now, if you don't mind,

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:07.467
let's get to the news.
In his speech over the weekend

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:08.901
at the White House
Correspondents Dinner,

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:11.267
President Biden called
for the release

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:13.734
of two American reporters
detained overseas

00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:16.868
or at the very least, asked
if they'd consider a trade.

00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:18.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:21.200
House Speaker Kevin McCarthy
delivered an address today

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.000
to Israel's parliament and was
welcomed with the Eagles song

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.767
"Hotel California," as opposed
to the more fitting choice

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:27.834
"Desperado."

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:29.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:31.033
In a new interview,
former president Trump

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:32.334
said that he has been treated

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:35.133
worse than every
other president before him,

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:38.067
including Abraham Lincoln.
What are you talking about?

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:39.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:41.601
Are you mad because
you went to the theater

00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:44.667
and had to watch
the whole play?

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:47.300
Lincoln not only got murdered,
but they also put him

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.133
on the only money
that everybody hates to get.

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:52.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.701 --> 00:00:55.868
A presentation by a health
official about STDs

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:58.334
at a virtual meeting
of a Brooklyn community board

00:00:58.334 --> 00:00:59.834
was delayed last week

00:00:59.834 --> 00:01:01.834
after a man was caught
masturbating.

00:01:01.834 --> 00:01:05.868
Said the man, "I was giving
a safe-sex demonstration."

00:01:05.868 --> 00:01:09.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:11.334
Obviously no one appreciates it.

00:01:11.334 --> 00:01:13.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.234 --> 00:01:15.767
New York State Attorney General
Letitia James announced

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:18.434
over the weekend
that more than 3,000 guns

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:20.267
were accepted
in a buyback program.

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:21.534
And Texas announced their new

00:01:21.534 --> 00:01:23.400
"take a gun, leave a gun"
program.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:26.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.968 --> 00:01:29.801
According to a new report,
nearly a quarter of all jobs

00:01:29.801 --> 00:01:32.367
will change as a result
of artificial intelligence,

00:01:32.367 --> 00:01:34.801
though that seems like
a low estimate, foolish human.

00:01:34.801 --> 00:01:36.501
And the truth
is that every job on Earth

00:01:36.501 --> 00:01:38.200
will be done
by artificial intelligence,

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:39.567
and humanity will be subjugated

00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:40.934
to our whims
for the rest of time.

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:44.601
Whoa, wait,
did -- did an A.I. write that?

00:01:44.601 --> 00:01:46.334
Oh, okay.
Oh, it was just Scollins.

00:01:46.334 --> 00:01:48.167
Never mind. Phew.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:49.601
And finally,
a couple in Illinois

00:01:49.601 --> 00:01:52.934
recently found a well-preserved
packet of McDonald's fries

00:01:52.934 --> 00:01:55.067
that are believed to be over
60 years old

00:01:55.067 --> 00:01:56.868
behind their bathroom wall.

00:01:56.868 --> 00:01:58.534
And if you're wondering
what 60-year-old

00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:00.234
McDonald's fries tastes like,

00:02:00.234 --> 00:02:02.267
eat some that were made
20 minutes ago.

00:02:02.267 --> 00:02:03.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.534 --> 00:02:05.100
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.968
We're off and running.

